usage: verify.py [-h] (--selftest | --check)

Independently verify the t52 v5 merge, source hashes, protected v4 blocks,
field grades, and unresolved t49/t50 framing conflict.

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --selftest  run isolated verifier selftests
  --check     verify the v5 schema against frozen baseline and source
              artifacts

